  "referenceNumber": "RUS0218",
  "remarks": "\nNemtsev became Chair of the “Legislative Assembly” of Sevastopol in September 2019. Nemtsev is also leader of United Russia’s Sevastopol branch and involved in the Russian-organised illegal local elections, which undermined Ukrainian sovereignty. He has also been awarded a medal for the “return of Crimea” from the Russian Defence Ministry, demonstrating his involvement in activities undermining Ukrainian territorial integrity. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
